tapete de prote\u00e7\u00e3o de borracha tornam esta m\u00e1quina de lavar loi\u00e7a da Haier adequada para cuidar de toda a sua loi\u00e7a, mesmo as mais delicadas. Assim, a cada ciclo n\u00e3o ter\u00e1 de se preocupar com cristais, cer\u00e2micas, copos de vinho e muito mais.<br><br><b>N\u00e3o corra riscos com o sistema Total water block<\/b><br>Evite inunda\u00e7\u00f5es devido a avarias da m\u00e1quina ou fraturas nos tubos de borracha devido ao Total Sistema Water Block da Washlens Plus. Esta solu\u00e7\u00e3o inteligente melhora drasticamente a seguran\u00e7a da m\u00e1quina de lavar loi\u00e7a, evitando qualquer risco para os utilizadores e para o ambiente.","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"HAIER","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":null,"unit_price":668.92,"unit_price_tax":668.92,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Eletrodom\u00e9sticos","brand":"HAIER","image":"https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/5\/3\/1\/9\/0\/2\/531902.jpg","galeria":"https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/5\/3\/1\/9\/0\/2\/531902.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/5\/3\/1\/9\/0\/3\/531903.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/5\/3\/1\/9\/0\/4\/531904.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/5\/3\/1\/9\/0\/5\/531905.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/5\/3\/1\/9\/0\/6\/531906.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/5\/3\/1\/9\/0\/7\/531907.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/5\/3\/1\/9\/0\/8\/531908.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/5\/3\/1\/9\/0\/9\/531909.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/5\/3\/1\/9\/1\/0\/531910.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/5\/3\/1\/9\/1\/1\/531911.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/5\/3\/1\/9\/1\/2\/531912.jpg,https:\/\/experteletro.pt\/img\/p\/5\/3\/1\